'''Ömer Faruk Yurtseven''' (born 19 June 1998) is a Turkish professional [[basketball]] player for [[Real Madrid Baloncesto|Real Madrid]] of the Spanish [[Liga ACB]]. He played [[college basketball]] for the [[NC State Wolfpack men's basketball|NC State Wolfpack]] and [[Georgetown Hoyas men's basketball|Georgetown Hoyas]]. He plays the [[Center (basketball)|center]] position.<ref>[http://www.draftexpress.com/profile/Omer-Yurtseven-73269/ Ömer Faruk Yurtseven Draft Express Profile]</ref>

